{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e02-scene-18",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "调整后台布局  (Redesigning the Backstage Layout)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "lin_jie": "林姐",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "crew": "场务"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Backstage at the studio, Bu Xiaogu spots a bottleneck in how the dressing rooms are arranged and pitches an overnight fix to Lin Jie right before Xin Huimei arrives. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "报告林姐，我有话想说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得后台的化妆间不太合理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "艺人走后台也不方便。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果换一下房间，效率会高很多。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "现在录制太忙了，来不及调整。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我可以负责安排，一个晚上就能做好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我再请几个同事过来帮忙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "你先画一张图，明天让我看一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好的，林姐！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "小谷，这个新布局真清楚，真棒！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "林姐，辛惠美来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "好，大家快去准备吧！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's unpack what they say. Xiaogu steps up to Lin Jie with an idea to make backstage traffic smoother.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "报告林姐，我有话想说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Reporting in, Lin Jie, I have something to say.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得后台的化妆间不太合理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I feel the backstage dressing rooms are not very reasonable.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "艺人走后台也不方便。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is inconvenient for the artists walking backstage too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果换一下房间，效率会高很多。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If we swap the rooms around, efficiency will be much higher.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "现在录制太忙了，来不及调整。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now taping is too busy, there is no time to adjust.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我可以负责安排，一个晚上就能做好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I can take charge of the setup and finish in one night.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我再请几个同事过来帮忙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will also ask a few colleagues to come over and help.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "你先画一张图，明天让我看一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Draw a floor plan first and let me take a look tomorrow.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好的，林姐！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Got it, Lin Jie!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "小谷，这个新布局真清楚，真棒！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, this new layout is really clear, great job!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "林姐，辛惠美来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lin Jie, Xin Huimei has arrived!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "好，大家快去准备吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good, everyone go get ready right away!'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "报告林姐，我有话想说。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得后台的化妆间不太合理。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "艺人走后台也不方便。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果换一下房间，效率会高很多。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "现在录制太忙了，来不及调整。",
      "gap": 0.5
