    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我可以负责安排，一个晚上就能做好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我再请几个同事过来帮忙。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "你先画一张图，明天让我看一下。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好的，林姐！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "小谷，这个新布局真清楚，真棒！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "林姐，辛惠美来了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "好，大家快去准备吧！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Xiaogu's clear backstage floor plan wins Lin Jie's praise just as guest mentor Xin Huimei walks into the studio. You learned \"houtai\" for backstage, \"huazhuangjian\" for dressing room, and \"laibuji\" when time is too tight. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
